### 창작자: 정산 계좌 등록·변경 (계좌번호 999로 시작하면 모의 송금 실패, 998은 일시 오류)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/settlement-account
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankCode": "004",
  "accountNumber": "12345678901234",
  "holderName": "홍길동"
}

### 창작자: 세금 정보 등록·변경 (개인 = 주민등록번호, 사업자 = businessNo)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/tax-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "creatorType": "INDIVIDUAL",
  "legalName": "홍길동",
  "residentNo": "9001011234567"
}

### 창작자: 내 정산 정보
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/settlement-info
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 정산 계좌 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/creators/1/settlement-account/review
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approved": true }

### 관리자: 세금 정보 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/creators/1/tax-profile/review
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approved": true }

### 창작자: 출금 신청 (10,000원 이상)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/withdrawals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{ "amount": 10000 }

> {%
    client.global.set("withdrawalId", response.body.withdrawalId);
%}

### 창작자: 내 출금 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/withdrawals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 출금 대기 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/withdrawals?status=REQUESTED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 출금 승인 → 원천징수 후 송금
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/withdrawals/{{withdrawalId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 출금 반려 (금액 복구)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/withdrawals/{{withdrawalId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "계좌 확인 필요" }

### 관리자: 지급 재시도 (PENDING만)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payouts/1/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
